Systematic mapping study  (also referred to as a scopi ng study). A broad review of
prim ary stud ies in a spec ific topic are a that aims to identify what evid ence is availab le
on the top ic.

Tertiary stu dy (also called a ter tiary  review) . A review of secondary studies related to
the sam e research question.

