  41
Staples and Niazi [27] also emphasize the ne ed to keep a record  of what happens
during the conduct of the revi ew. They point out that you need to report deviations
from the protocol.

With respect to publishing systematic liter ature reviews, the J ournal of Information
and Software Technology (http://www.elsevier.com/wps/find/homepage.cws_home)
has expressed a willingness to publis h systematic literature reviews.

